From 33120aae62843c8dc3c4a4be39cc9e0df806aaca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:40:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] patch 0241 -- #37: gate GF1 SFX upload on _sfx_off
 (music-only GUS fallback)

#31's _sfx_off gated SFX PLAYBACK (playSfx/stopSfx no-op) but NOT the upload:
SoundManager's gus path called Pixtone::initGusSfx() unconditionally (0239), so
SFX_OFF=1 / SFX_DEVICE=none still uploaded the whole SFX bank -- no music-only
GUS, and no way to dodge the #36 SFX-upload crash.

Fix: gate the initGusSfx() + updateSfxVolume() call on !_sfx_off. When sfx-off,
skip the SFX upload entirely -- (a) the full card DRAM is then free for the
per-song .pat instruments (MidiBackendGus's keep-mark auto-snapshots 0), and
(b) the SFX-upload path is never entered, giving a clean MUSIC-ONLY GUS the
operator can use to hear native GF1 wavetable music (and to dodge #36 until
its fix lands).

New slot (not an amend of 0239): _sfx_off is resolved in 0240 (#31), so the
gate -- which references _sfx_off -- must sit AFTER 0240 in the series.

Built clean; full nx series re-applies (0238->0239->0240->0241); defaults +
the SFX-on GUS path byte-identical (the gate is a no-op unless sfx-off).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/sound/SoundManager.cpp | 28 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/sound/SoundManager.cpp b/src/sound/SoundManager.cpp
index 8c704a88..b1b73e6d 100644
--- a/src/sound/SoundManager.cpp
+++ b/src/sound/SoundManager.cpp
@@ -1269,11 +1269,29 @@ bool SoundManager::init()
     // the GF1 via MidiBackendGus). Runs AFTER the gus backend install above, so
     // SDL_DOSGusInit has brought the card up. updateSfxVolume() sets the GF1
     // per-voice SFX volume used by the gus play path.
-    Pixtone::getInstance()->initGusSfx();
-    updateSfxVolume();
-    LOG_INFO("Sound system: GUS path -- Pixtone SFX uploaded to GF1 voices "
-             "(#28); music via MidiBackendGus on the same shared GF1 voice "
-             "pool. No SDL3_mixer / Organya.");
+    //
+    // patch 0241 (#37): gate the SFX UPLOAD on _sfx_off (#31's sfx-off state,
+    // SFX_OFF=1 / SFX_DEVICE=none). #31 only gated SFX PLAYBACK; the upload ran
+    // unconditionally, so there was no music-only GUS. Skipping initGusSfx when
+    // sfx-off (a) frees the whole card DRAM for the per-song .pat instruments
+    // (no SFX bank, so MidiBackendGus's keep-mark auto-snapshots 0), and (b)
+    // gives a MUSIC-ONLY GUS fallback that dodges the SFX-upload path entirely
+    // (relevant to the #36 SFX-upload crash until its fix lands).
+    if (!_sfx_off)
+    {
+      Pixtone::getInstance()->initGusSfx();
+      updateSfxVolume();
+      LOG_INFO("Sound system: GUS path -- Pixtone SFX uploaded to GF1 voices "
+               "(#28); music via MidiBackendGus on the same shared GF1 voice "
+               "pool. No SDL3_mixer / Organya.");
+    }
+    else
+    {
+      LOG_INFO("Sound system: GUS path -- SFX DISABLED (SFX_OFF/SFX_DEVICE=none, "
+               "#37); skipping the GF1 SFX upload. MUSIC-ONLY GUS: the full card "
+               "DRAM is free for the per-song .pat instruments, and the SFX "
+               "upload path is not entered at all.");
+    }
   }
   else
   {
